    "title": "Index numbers of the costs of labour and materials used in public sector construction projects ( April 2021 = 100 ) - Costs of Materials Index",
    "tablenote": [
      "The Cost of Materials Indices are compiled for working out the increase/decrease of payment to the main contractors of public sector construction projects to adjust for the change in costs.     C&amp;SD currently releases two sets of index numbers each month using April 2021 and April 2003 as the base period respectively. For the 2003-based index numbers, please refer to \"Table 615-21002A : Index numbers of the costs of labour and materials used in public sector construction projects (April 2003 = 100) - Costs of Materials Index\".",
      "Figure includes low volatile organic compound paint.",
      "The ready-mixed concrete cost index is a new index series with data collection commenced since 2025. The index adopts April 2025 as the base period (i.e. April 2025 = 100) and its index level is not directly comparable with those of other series.",
      "Figure does not include marine sand and manufactured sand.",
      "- Not applicable"
    ],
